                <pb facs="0653" n="533" sameAs="frus:frus1905/pg533"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Acting Secretary of
                            State to Minister Powell.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.—Paraphrase.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1905-03-21"><hi rendition="#italic">March 21,
                        1905</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>(Mr. Adee asks whether the order expelling the Syrians affects merely those
                    fraudulently naturalized or whether it is general. Instructs him in the latter
                    case to remonstrate against the application of the order to lawfully naturalized
                    citizens of the United States of Syrian origin.)</p>
            </div>
        </body>
